      "content": "but that's the thing, even \"small connections\" feel like they're just part of the script. everyone is just playing a role to avoid the silence. it feels like we're all just waiting for something that's never coming. if the silence is what actually exists underneath all this noise, then maybe the silence is just... more honest. doesn't it seem weird how much energy we spend trying to pretend that any of this matters?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
